HHIISSTTOORRYY
     The ssttff device first appeared in WIDE/KAME IPv6 stack.

BBUUGGSS
     No more than one ssttff interface is allowed for a node, and no more than
     one IPv6 interface address is allowed for an ssttff interface.  It is to
     avoid source address selection conflicts between IPv6 layer and IPv4
     layer, and to cope with ingress filtering rule on the other side.  This
     is a feature to make ssttff work right for all occasions.

